    <comment>Crypto invoice, Bitcoin only: shown in place of crypto_invoice_quote_expired and its Refresh quote button for up to 3 hours after a Bitcoin quote expires with nothing received yet. The server sees a Bitcoin payment only once it is confirmed (mined), so one sent in time may still be on its way, and it is credited at the quoted price. "pay another way" refers to the button crypto_invoice_pay_another_way.</comment>
