    <comment>Crypto invoice, Bitcoin only: shown under the quote's countdown while the invoice can be paid. The server sees a Bitcoin payment only once it is confirmed (mined), which can take hours, and credits a payment sent before the quote expires at the quoted price if it confirms within 3 hours of the expiry. "this price" is the price on the invoice. Bitcoin is a product name.</comment>
  </data>
